# Claude Code
# Only the machine-local half is ignored. The agents, the skill and the shared settings
# are project infrastructure: a clone without them has the units, the style guide and
# every gate, and nothing that knows how to run them.
/.claude/settings.local.json
# CLAUDE.md is tracked: it carries the documentation policy every agent works to, and a
# fresh clone or worktree that silently lacked it would produce work to no rules at all.

